Enhancement: Offer to delete the local folder when removing an account or sync connection

Removing an account or a folder sync connection kept the local folder on disk
without offering any choice. On the next account setup the client therefore
found the old folder still present and created a numbered duplicate such as
"ownCloud (2)", "ownCloud (3)" and so on.

The removal confirmations now offer an opt-in checkbox to also delete the local
folder. It is unchecked by default, so the existing safe behaviour is
preserved. When checked, the folder is moved to the operating system trash so
the action stays recoverable.

https://github.com/owncloud/client/issues/12687
